$$

At the end of the evening, 14 pieces of pie remained. To find out how many pieces were taken by the guests, we subtract the remaining pieces from the total number of pieces:

$$
40 \text{ total pieces} - 14 \text{ remaining pieces} = 26 \text{ pieces taken}
$$

