Then, a boy got 6 liters. So we need to subtract the amounts taken by the girls and the boy from the original 24 liters to find out how much is left. So total taken is 8 liters (girls) plus 6 liters (boy) equals 14 liters. Subtract that from 24 liters. 24 minus 14 is 10. So, there are 10 liters left. 

